    "detailed_description": "Explore the infinite spaces beyond the reality you know, as you fall into the eerie levels of the backrooms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels</h2>Each level has a unique aesthetic, the geometry is weird, yet somehow familiar, as if something tried to put it together, but that something is not human. You will have to traverse the spaces carefully, because the walls themselves will try to kill you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785620/extras/0747a383e70467edcc011e4d8e1ad7e9.poster.avif?t=1744374905\" width=544 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785620/extras/0747a383e70467edcc011e4d8e1ad7e9.webm?t=1744374905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785620/extras/0747a383e70467edcc011e4d8e1ad7e9.mp4?t=1744374905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Entities</h2>Weird abominable creatures live here, and most of them want you dead. How you may survive them, is a challenge you will have to overcome. Let's hope you won't lose any limbs in the process.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785620/extras/d66d3c6919333c9061f98ecdb8ada99d.poster.avif?t=1744374905\" width=544 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785620/extras/d66d3c6919333c9061f98ecdb8ada99d.webm?t=1744374905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785620/extras/d66d3c6919333c9061f98ecdb8ada99d.mp4?t=1744374905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles</h2>The backrooms will put your intelligence to the test. Sorry, you will not get a participation trophy here if you fail, you will just become smeared paste.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785620/extras/f4c16bca7b39983c858e899f0affa96b.poster.avif?t=1744374905\" width=544 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785620/extras/f4c16bca7b39983c858e899f0affa96b.webm?t=1744374905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785620/extras/f4c16bca7b39983c858e899f0affa96b.mp4?t=1744374905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2>The backrooms welcomes wanderers from all over the world. Will your teammates help you survive, or will they become ground meat for the entities?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785620/extras/b11b7544bdc1b6fc85dcc3f3f7a06239.poster.avif?t=1744374905\" width=544 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785620/extras/b11b7544bdc1b6fc85dcc3f3f7a06239.webm?t=1744374905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785620/extras/b11b7544bdc1b6fc85dcc3f3f7a06239.mp4?t=1744374905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
